# Normalise to LF in the repository and in every working tree. Without this,
# Windows checkouts get CRLF, Prettier's endOfLine:"lf" check fails locally
# while passing in Linux CI, and diffs show whole files as changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.sqlite binary
